    "https://northcentraluniversity.applytojob.com/apply/I90qkHntyu/STUDENT-JOB-Athletics-Game-Day-Student-Worker?source=Our Career Page Widget": {
      "title": "Available Position (Company name withheld)",
      "description": "STUDENT JOB: Athletics Game Day Student Worker - Career Page Skip To Job Description View All Jobs Available Position (Company name withheld) STUDENT JOB: Athletics Game Day Student Worker Minneapolis, MN Temporary Student Job Student (College) Share Athletics Game Day Student Worker Job Info Position title: Athletics Game Day Student Worker Job type: Student Employment, Part time Department: Athletics Hourly Rate $15.97 Position purpose This position will assist with NCU Athletics home sporting events. Responsibilities include but are not limited to Staff NCU Rams home events. Multiple roles for each sport. See roles below. Athletic Communications: Statistician Stats Caller Live Stream Operator Play-by-play Commentator Camera Operator Photographer Videographer Gameday: PA Announcer/Music Admissions/Concessions Scoreboard Operator Official Scorer Scorebook/Libero Tracking Game Clock Shot Clock Ball Runners Required qualifications/skills Currently enrolled student at NCU Available to work nights and weekends Majoring in Sports Management or related field (preferred) Additional comments Hours/week: 6-10 hours/week (random) Hours: afternoons/evenings and weekends For more information, contact Konnor Jusczak at [email protected] The aforementioned statements are not intended to encompass all functions and qualifications of the position; rather, they are intended to provide a general framework of the requirements of the position. Job incumbents may be required to perform other functions not specifically addressed in this job description. Share Apply Apply for this position Required * First Name * Last Name * Email Address * Phone * Address Resume * We've received your resume. Click here to update it. Attach resume or Paste resume Attach resume as .pdf, .doc, .docx, .odt, .txt, or .rtf (limit 5MB) or Paste resume Paste your resume here or Attach resume file Student ID Number * NCU Email Address * Major/Minor * Are you over 18? * -- No answer -- Yes N