    "https://northcentraluniversity.applytojob.com/apply/Aj3eBIAoZt/STUDENT-JOB-General-Custodian?source=Our Career Page Widget": {
      "title": "Available Position (Company name withheld)",
      "description": "STUDENT JOB: General Custodian - Career Page Skip To Job Description View All Jobs Available Position (Company name withheld) STUDENT JOB: General Custodian Minneapolis, MN Temporary Student Job Student (College) Share GENERAL CUSTODIAN Job Info Position title: General Custodian Position purpose The General Custodian is assigned to a team that will be responsible for the custodial services of a specific area of campus. Responsibilities include but are not limited to General cleaning- dusting, glass cleaning, sweeping, mopping, vacuuming, straightening furniture, and removal of trash/recycling Cleaning of the restrooms/shower rooms and/or locker rooms with a no-touch cleaning system and at times a cleaning cart Stocking custodial supplies (i.e., toilet paper, soap, etc.) Removal of trash and recycling as needed Disinfecting high-touch surfaces, areas experiencing an increase in infections (cold/flu) Additional Tasks- setup and/or tear-down of special events on campus Required qualifications/skills Currently enrolled student at NCU Prior cleaning experience preferred but not required Must complete additional Housekeeping Department interview questions on student employment application Additional comments Hiring timeline: 1-2 weeks from interview Hours/week: 15 hours during weekdays, 12 hours during weekends Time: Weekday Shift (Monday – Friday from 6pm-9pm) or Weekend Shift (Saturday 8am-4:30p & Sunday 1:30pm-5:30pm) FOR MORE INFORMATION, CONTACT Brandon Watson at 612.343.4479 or [email protected] The aforementioned statements are not intended to encompass all functions and qualifications of the position; rather, they are intended to provide a general framework of the requirements of the position. Job incumbents may be required to perform other functions not specifically addressed in this job description. Share Apply Apply for this position Required * First Name * Last Name * Email Address * Phone * Address Resume * We've received your resume. Click here to update it. Attach resume or Paste resume Attach resume as .pdf, .doc, .docx, .odt, .txt, or .rtf (limit 5MB) or Paste resume Paste your resume here or Attach resume file Student ID Number * NCU Email Address * Major/Minor * Are you over 18? * -- No answer -- Yes No Class Standing * -- No answer -- Freshman Sophomore Junior Senior Anticipated Graduation Day * Are you currently employed on campus as a student worker? * -- No answer -- Yes No What is you style or philosophy of leadership? * In one of your previous jobs, what was an accomplishment you are proud of? Why? * What does customer service mean to you? * Human Check * Submit Application This website uses cookies and other analytics technologies. By selecting \"Allow\", you consent to the recording, use and sharing of your website activity by this website and its service providers. Allow Reject All Powered by"
